<title>SOUTH KOREA: Soccer-Results of South Korean pro soccer games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of South Korean pro soccer games.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean</p>
<p>professional soccer games played on Sunday.</p>
<p> Hyundai     1    Daewoo	0   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p> Chonnam     2    Chonbuk     2   (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Sunday (Tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Hyundai	     4     3    0     9     3    15</p>
<p> Daewoo		4     2    1     8     2    14</p>
<p> Pohang		3     3    1    10     7    12</p>
<p> Samsung	     3     3    1     6     5    12</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     1     4    2     9    10     7</p>
<p> Chonnam	     1     4    2     6     7     7</p>
<p> Taejon		1     4    2     6     8     7</p>
<p> LG		    0     6    1     8     9     6</p>
<p> Yukong		1     3    3     9    14     6</p>
<p> Ilwha		 0     2    5     4    10     2</p>
